{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_033_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:85151e329b6fb243dbb0bf1a6db79668e83b1ad5554d5af18941e4ca6b157126",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a36c7d704dadf123c0a58e8c0d9f1a44e17e02ab0d729dfac94397568e1ed09",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，找到你啦！\n嘿嘿～，我送你个好东西！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f4c801ad5165e28883d98ccb09c4c505e8400aa7860c272470a597369b848a",
      "text": "要问是什么……当然是白色情人节的回礼啦！\n我可是好～好准备了的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da9b03064a93e03c5b9a99ca4a7fb186b5c7eca32beb35fe0525c4bbfa8a549",
      "text": "超努力地挑选出来的！\n给我乖乖收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc56d161c919f014cf316c63dd1dc2309fefc5b8ca98a0f8f11ad5d96d12a7b0",
      "text": "那巧克力，真的超级好吃的。\n明年你最好准备得更多一点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53074d12f8a8b4b1843fc4bb7172d80d996f65d9df8c53aae283d8109bfb39be",
      "text": "因为到了那时候，我一定会成为更让人想送巧克力的\n大偶像的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf326c27367f137510ee72d531ea734229761b77eca682b73e0ff396447438b1",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，还记得吗？\n你看，就是那个啦那个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:741f4a228671037549495664b1a2e09ed52a069c8aa807633b8f34726fc54e96",
      "text": "白色情人节的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:524f7f4a904ab71906a7467a90b2887fe97e53a57ad1724726c5a34e6405eb52",
      "text": "在送什么好上面我可是超级纠结的哦？\n不过，我找到了超棒的好东西！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d077a27fa9100c48c03d04e7f2bd3bbcd09827bc70c3ed95261d524dd09d6c",
      "text": "看到的那一瞬间，我就觉得绝对非它莫属了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e155831d741e872bcee9cbf64890f49e5faa61c9bb0a75eafdf664dcff4ebe9",
      "text": "绝对是能让你高兴的东西啦。\n给，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9adb350b9a2d1462a2f120d0976c7da555572bf493d6ee8142ce31997ce9310",
      "text": "好开心！很期待拆开呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e3b3deb52ae2b46271ca37264670da42acd28dfa8169c3c34d672cb57c034af",
      "text": "嘿嘿，不客气啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636bf7410addd714bce41805c901c36a0ce42cf54a267a45a59e24f85a4b388d",
      "text": "我想制作人也绝对会喜欢的！\n毕竟可是我挑出来的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_033_22:5_02_033_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39fda86676bae7079a6028e900f9aa0dd04390c9f3c7ad2f8800460fdc68b87d",
      "text": "喂喂，尽量快点拆开来看哦！\n因为我很想听你的感想嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
